    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA most spacious extended bungalow less than 5 mins from Lismore Heritage town!Situated in the rolling countryside of Glencairn, this deceptive bungalow is just 3km from the town centre. Standing on 0.54 of an acre and surrounded by mature landscaped south facing gardens - the property is in turn-key condition.Inside, there is over 2,000 sq.ft on offer with 3 reception rooms and an upstairs bedroom with feature balcony.The kitchen/dining is to the rear and opens onto the south facing patio. This room has been re-modelled in recent years and boasts extensive modern fitted units. Double doors lead to the lounge which is a spacious and bright room.Off the centre hallway, 3 of the 4 bedrooms are accessed with the master having its own ensuite and the upgraded shower room servicing the other two. At the end of the hall, there is a cosy sitting room that has double doors that open to a most impressive living room. This room is in the extended section of the house and has windows to the patio area and has an adjoining porch. A feature stairs leads from this room to the upstairs ensuite bedroom. Externally, there is a fully equipped external utility room just off the kitchen. The gardens beyond are exquisite and impeccably maintained by the current owners with some lovely individual lawned and patio areas to relax as well as a large vegetable garden at the end with fruit trees and raised beds. To the side of the property there is a greenhouse and steel tech garden shed. Chester View is a gem in the Lismore countryside and given its private and secluded nature - needs to be viewed to be appreciated."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>A most spacious extended property - over 2,000 sq.ft.</li><li>3 reception rooms - lounge, living & sitting room. </li><li>Private secluded site - 5 mins/3km to Lismore town.</li><li>Exquisite landscaped gardens with fruit trees. </li><li>4 bedrooms - 2 ensuite.</li><li>New kitchen in recent times. </li><li>South facing private patio. </li><li>External utility room. </li><li>Greenhouse & steel tech shed. </li><li>Originally built in 1995 - extended 2005. </li><li>Mains water & septic tank.</ul>"
      },
